B.AW=new A.aQ(61170,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.anK=new A.d2("How it works","Watermarked links are made from a file in one of your groups, so Send adds the file to a group first. You set how long the link works and how many times it can be opened.",!1)
B.aoa=new A.d2("What the reader sees","A clean page with one small grey line at the bottom: their name, part of their email, and the time they opened it. A typed email is marked UNVERIFIED. The first time, a note tells them the copy is marked for them.",!1)
B.anQ=new A.d2("If they try to copy it","Printing, copying or pressing PrintScreen covers the page in their name and email for the rest of that visit, and the attempt is logged.",!1)
B.aod=new A.d2("What you see","Each link has a log of when it was opened. You can revoke it at any time.",!1)
B.anG=new A.d2("In a browser","A browser cannot block screenshots. The line on every page is what points back to the reader.",!0)
