B.bj1=s(["Police, banks, the RBI and 1930 never ask you to pay to release a refund.","A refund only goes back into your own account. You never send money to receive it.","Scammers buy lists of victims. They may call as police, a lawyer or a recovery agent, and know your case details.","Never share an OTP, your UPI PIN or your screen with anyone who calls about your case.","If someone asks for money to recover money, hang up and call 1930."],t.s)
